          "type": "h1",
          "text": "Our People"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The people who serve Venezuela come from different places and different lives, but they share one thing—a commitment to help those who suffer. We are doctors and teachers, business people and students, all of us bound by faith and the belief that change is possible."
